## 4. Images & Media Rules (Per Section)

### 4.1 Asset Storage Locations
* All image assets live in the Next.js `public/` directory:
  * General Illustrations & Backgrounds: `public/` (e.g. `public/kaartu.jpeg`, `public/landscape.png`)
  * Art Gallery Assets: `public/gallery/` (e.g. `public/gallery/canvas-1.jpeg`)

### 4.2 Path & URL Reference Formats
* **When referenced in Next.js `<Image src="..." />` props or array objects:**
  * Must begin with a leading forward slash: `"/gallery/swan.jpeg"`, `"/kaartu.jpeg"`, `"/portrait.png"`.
* **When referenced inside inline `[IMAGE:...]` tags in text content:**
  * The code uses: `src.replace("[IMAGE:", "").replace("]", "")` and renders `<Image src={`/${src}`} ... />`.
  * Therefore, **do NOT include the leading slash inside the tag**:
    * Correct: `[IMAGE:kaartu.jpeg]` or `[IMAGE:gallery/canvas-1.jpeg]`
    * Incorrect: `[IMAGE:/kaartu.jpeg]` (would produce `//kaartu.jpeg`)

### 4.3 Media Usage per Section

| Section | Supported Formats | Expected Dimensions / Aspect | Single or Multi-Image |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Series / Chapters** | `.jpeg`, `.jpg`, `.png` | Standard photography / scanned letters (e.g. `800x600`). Rendered inside text at `max-w-md` with `rounded-2xl shadow-sm`. | Multiple allowed throughout chapter via individual `[IMAGE:filename]` blocks. |
| **Soul Notes** | `.jpeg`, `.jpg`, `.png` | Centered illustration (e.g. `mataji.jpeg`, `birthdayletter.jpeg`). | Multiple allowed via `[IMAGE:filename]` blocks. |
| **Musings** | `.jpeg`, `.jpg`, `.png` | Inline story photo (e.g. `kaartu.jpeg`). | Multiple allowed via `[IMAGE:filename]` blocks. |
